        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Built our very first home with HSD and definitely was a great experience. From having to customize our house plan to helping us chose detailing on the house, HSD and their vendors have been so helpful. It's not easy to imagine our home based on measurements on a paper. But these guys know what they do and are prideful in their work for a reason.",
