        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent project overall, a very beautiful and well-designed construction. I had the opportunity to visit the Coteau-du-Lac project; the welcome was wonderful and very warm. The property was truly well-built and well-designed in terms of both style and decor. The bedrooms are a good size; it's truly a haven of peace in a very quiet and well-chosen new development. I encourage prospective buyers to visit; it's very convincing.",
